                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>The patient’s HbA1c is elevated, indicating suboptimal long-term glycemic control and likely poorly controlled diabetes. This increases the risk for microvascular and macrovascular complications, especially at her advanced age. Clinical correlation and consideration of diabetes management optimization are recommended.</td>
